       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe as written.\n\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The usual maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day.\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n\nA dose this high raises the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nCommon regimens are:\n- **Mild to moderate pain:** 400 mg PO every 4\u20136 hours as needed.\n- **Inflammatory or arthritic conditions:** 600\u2013800 mg PO three to four times daily. The maximum is 3,200 mg/day.\n\nDid you mean 400 mg or 800 mg four times daily, or something else, such as 1600 mg per day in total? If you really intend 1600 mg four times daily, tell me the clinical reason and I'll go from there. I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first.\n\nOnce you confirm the dose, I'll enter the order right away."
